<title>SWEDEN: Skanska says sells entire Geveko stake.</title>
<headline>Skanska says sells entire Geveko stake.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction group Skanska said on Friday that it had sold its entire stake in building equipment company AB Geveko.</p>
<p>This was equivalent to 20.19 percent of Geveko's capital and 7.96 percent of the votes.</p>
</text>
